<DocsLayout title="Keybindings">
  <p>MarkRust uses platform-standard modifier keys. See <a href="/docs/shortcuts">Keyboard shortcuts</a> for the full list.</p>

  <h2>Customization</h2>
  <p>Custom keybinding configuration is planned for v0.3. Currently shortcuts are fixed in the application.</p>

  <h2>Platform conventions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>macOS:</strong> Command (⌘) for file operations and editing</li>
    <li><strong>Linux:</strong> Ctrl for equivalent actions</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
